    "extraction_notes": [
      "For ZMM16, the p. 2 table gives VZnom = 16 V with VZT range 15.3 to 17.1 V at IZT = 5 mA; the schema has no nominal source kind, so the nominal paired value is recorded as typical.",
      "The same ZMM16 row gives ZZT = 40 ohm maximum, ZZK = 170 ohm maximum at IZK = 1 mA, and reverse leakage = 0.1 uA maximum at VR = 12 V; dynamic-resistance fields are outside this extraction schema.",
      "The electrically fit-relevant Tj = 25 degC forward-characteristics curve on p. 4 was digitized. Thermal, power-dissipation, and surge/thermal-resistance plots were excluded from fit evidence.",
      "No tabulated ZMM16V capacitance test point or reverse-recovery-time value is published; the generic capacitance plot was not used as a device-specific scalar capacitance value."
